{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "But, as long as I keep putting what I study into practice, I feel like I'm getting closer to my dream.": "",
  "You're really a helpful guy, you know that?": "",
  "Would you mind if I offered you a little something?": "",
  "Well, you'd still have to pay for it, but I came up with a new recipe based on what a foreign customer told me.": "",
  "We only have a limited amount of the ingredients, so we can't serve it to the public. But we'll make an exception for you, of course.": "",
  "Not at all! It's the least I could do to show our appreciation. Please try it whenever you'd like!": "",
  "[Please let me know if you need anything.]": "",
  "Excuse me? It's me, Megumi Hashimoto.": "",
  "Hashimoto-san. I've been expecting you. Please, have a seat.": "",
  "You mentioned wanting to investigate your husband on possible infidelity. Do you have a reason to suspect him?": "",
  "Yes. It's not a first-hand account, but I'm told he's been seen walking around with another woman, holding her hand.": "",
  "And would you say this witness is reliable?": "",
  "Not with absolute certainty, no...": "",
  "But lately it feels like my husband has been kind of cold and distant...": "",
  "So even if this is just a nasty rumor, I can't help but feel like I need to find out the truth.": "",
  "Yes. His name was Suguru Oka. He runs Oka Detective Agency.": "",
  "(Suguru Oka? I've never even heard of the guy.)": "",
  "And this... Oka-san, he told you he found no evidence of infidelity on your husband?": "",
  "Yes... But something about it doesn't feel right.": "",
  "Sorry... It's just my gut telling me that, really.": "",
  "That's why I wanted a second opinion. If I'm wrong, I'm wrong, but I have to be certain.": "",
  "I understand. And do you have any pictures of your husband? I'll need to be able to identify him.": "",
  "Certainly. His name is Takefumi Hashimoto.": "",
  "Can I ask what he does for a living?": "",
  "He owns a real estate company here in Kamurocho.": "",
  "(So he owns his own company? If he's successful, he's got money to burn.)": "",
  "Considering all that... Will you accept, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Yes, I will. But there is one thing...": "",
  "I'm happy to give you my perspective on this, but you have to know, it could very well turn out just like last time.": "",
  "Is that something you can accept?": "",
  "Yes. If it's the truth, I'll accept it.": "",
  "Great. It'll cost you 80,000 yen. Will that work for you?": "",
  "Of course. I just want to find out the truth and put this behind me, one way or another.": "",
  "(Not sure why I would turn up anything that the last guy didn't, but I guess sometimes results need to be confirmed.)": "",
  "My husband's real estate company is called Kiguchi Real Estate on East Shichifuku Street. Thank you, Yagami-san.": "",
  "(All right, no time like the present.)": "",
  "(This is where Megumi Hashimoto's husband works.)": "",
  "(I'm guessing he'll head home soon, so I just have to wait him out.)": "",
  "(That's my mark. Takefumi Hashimoto... All right, let's see where he's going.)": "",
  "(Better snap a picture while I can.)": "",
  "Hey, Yagami-san. Get any good shots today?": "",
  "Ha, turns out predators are most vulnerable when they're hunting prey.": "",
  "You learn something new everyday.": "",
  "...Who are you? Have you been tailing me?": "",
  "I'm in the same line of work as you, actually.": "",
  "...You're a detective?": "",
  "Yup. Name's Suguru Oka.": "",
  "Wait, Oka?": "",
  "...You're the guy Megumi-san hired to look into her husband, right?": "",
  "Sure am. And you're Yagami-san. I've heard a lot about you, actually.": "",
  "What an honor. So, why were you tailing me?": "",
  "Well, it shouldn't come as much surprise. The lady's husband hired me.": "",
  "He knew his wife wasn't satisfied with the results of my investigation, so he hired me to watch her.": "",
  "Which led you to watching me. But that doesn't add up.": "",
  "Wasn't it his wife who hired you to find out if he was cheating in the first place?": "",
  "If that's true, how did you end up working for the husband?": "",
  "C'mon, Yagami-san. Don't you get it? I was <font_kind=yakuza_italic>re-hired</font_kind> by the husband.": "",
  "Re-hired? What do you mean?": "",
  "When the wife hired me, I found enough evidence to prove her husband was a cheater, but all the same...": "",
  "Why would I give those pictures to her, when I could make double the money selling them to her husband?": "",
  "So you betrayed your client.": "",
  "Hey, this may come as a shock to a little daisy like you...": "",
  "But sometimes keeping food on the table means getting your hands dirty. You'll starve at your rate, Yagami.": "",
  "I think I'm doing fine.": "",
  "Look, let's talk business. I only told you all that because I've got a plan.": "",
  "That picture you just snapped is money for both of us.": "",
  "Good money, too. Leave it with me, and I guarantee I'll get you at least 500k.": "",
  "Wait, you wouldn't...": "",
  "You want to sell these pictures to the husband?": "",
  "Exactly. I'll tell him I had to buy them from his wife's second detective, and I'll mark 'em up good.": "",
  "And I'll split the payout 50/50 with you, which means you get a 25k payday. I'd say that's fair.": "",
  "Think about it, man. Wouldn't his wife be better off not knowing the truth anyway?": "",
  "You can't tell me you don't need a payday like that. So come on. What do you say?": "",
  "There's nothing to consider.": "",
  "Guy like you belongs in a street gang, not a detective agency.": "",
  "Any detective who'd sell his own clients short hardly deserves the title.": "",
  "(She's going to be pretty broken up about it...)": "",
  "You're thinking about it, aren't you? You know I'm right.": "",
  "N-No. I'd never do that.": "",
  "How lame. You don't even know your own stance on this shit.": "",
  "Well, I know I'd never call myself a detective if I was just in it to scam my clients.": "",
  "...That's a real shame. Here I was thinking we could be buds.": "",
  "What would give you that idea? You're giving the whole profession a bad name, and I want no part of it.": "",
  "Well if you're going to hardline me, you leave me no choice...": "",
  "...This is how negotiations usually end for you, I take it?": "",
  "Yup. I'm getting that photo, whether you like it or not.": "",
  "...Tch.": "",
  "Lying, bribes, blackmail, \"excessive\" force... It all comes with the territory, my friend. You've got a lot to learn.": "",
  "So let me be the teacher this time! I'll show you how detectives have to live!": "",
  "What was that about showing me how detectives live?": "",
  "Y-You beat all these guys!? What the fuck!?": "",
  "This whole sorry mess will be in my report. But don't come crying to me when your rep is too shot to get work.": "",
  "Far as I'm concerned, you brought this on yourself. Take some time to consider where your values got you in life.": "",
  "D-Damn you...!": "",
  "Damn. That was more trouble than I expected, but at least I got sufficient evidence.": "",
  "Hello, Hashimoto-san? I'm ready to make my report about your husband.": "",
  "You found the truth? Is it... bad news?": "",
  "I'm afraid so.": "",
  "I'll give you the details at my office. Would you mind meeting me there?": "",
  "Of course, but... Would you mind if I brought my husband?": "",
  "Your husband, Ma'am?": "",
  "Yes, I have a feeling he's going to try to weasel his way out of it.": "",
  "I'd like to have an eye-witness as my back-up...": "",
  "Okay... Whenever you're ready, meet me at my office with your husband.": "",
  "...And that's my report. I think it's safe to say your husband has been cheating on you.": "",
  "...Hah! This is ridiculous. It's a completely innocent kiss.": "",
  "Megumi, I know it looks bad, but you still trust me, don't you?": "",
  "Sir, does the name Suguru Oka ring any bells? He's another PI I believe you're familiar with.": "",
  "...No?": "",
  "No? You paid the man to dispose of the evidence he had against you, did you not?": "",
  "There's no use lying about it.": "",
  "...Ngh... No! No, no, no! I don't know anything about this!": "",
  "So I was played for a fool twice... By the other investigator, and you.": "",
  "To think that I trusted you!": "",
  "Ah, no, you've got it all wrong!": "",
  "I trust you can handle the rest, Hashimoto-san?": "",
  "...Yes. I have a lot to think about.": "",
  "Thank you for everything, Yagami-san.": "",
  "W-Wait, let's not do anything hasty, Megumi! It was just one mistake!": "",
  "You've gotta forgive me, Megumi!": "",
  "(\"How detectives have to live,\" huh? Maybe, but my way is working out fine so far.)": "",
  "(Nice, I got that kiss on camera. He's certainly not talking his way out of this one.)": "",
  "(I got a shot of them getting intimate. It's not as close as I would've liked, but this'll do.)": "",
  "And according to your request, you've had another PI look into this as well?": "",
  "(This picture will be enough to prove the husband's infidelity.)": "",
  "Well hey, Tak. You're a sight for sore eyes.": "",
  "Right back at you. How's business these days?": "",
  "Fabulous as always. Do you even need to ask?": "",
  "Hah, I guess not. How do I get on your level, Mari? Teach me the ways.": "",
  "Hmm... Lately I've been thinking about the secret to success... And I think it depends entirely on one's insight.": "",
  "Insight?": "",
  "Yes. For instance, I gain a lot by reading people's gestures and facial expressions. That's how I make my moves.": "",
  "Huh. Color me impressed.": "",
  "Oh, I'm sure you're just as good. You <font_kind=yakuza_italic>are</font_kind> a detective, aren't you?": "",
  "Haha, well, yes.": "",
  "Then why don't you and I play a little game?": "",
  "What kind of game?": "",
  "You see that office worker type sitting over there?": "",
  "Let's bet on how many more drinks he'll take before he uses the restroom.": "",
  "You can really infer that?": "",
  "Yup. I'd say he's good for three more.": "",
  "Uh... Okay...?": "",
  "Ahaha, you're not getting it, are you? Let me give you a hint.": "",
  "I noticed he came back from the restroom not too long ago, so let's assume he's feeling pretty relieved.": "",
  "Now, Tak. If you had to guess, how many more drinks will it take to send him back to the little boy's room?": "",
  "Hmm... Let me think this through.": "",
  "(Maybe his body language will give me some kind of hint.)": "",
  "(I don't see him squirming around or eyeballing the restroom or anything like that. Maybe he's still good?)": "",
  "You're just going to stare at him and hope the answer comes to you?": "",
  "Give me a second here.": "",
  "(His face isn't red or anything like that. Did he just start drinking?)": "",
  "I see you squinting, Tak...": "",
  "Yeah, a good detective's got a good squint, Mari. Patience.": "",
  "(What's he drinking over there?)": "",
  "Hey chief, what's that guy having?": "",
  "Hm? Oh, a Red Eye.": "",
  "Ah, okay. That's a cocktail with tomato juice and beer, right?": "",
  "You got it.": "",
  "(Tomato juice is rich in potassium, which is a natural diuretic...)": "",
  "(Which may just mean he'll get up to use the restroom sooner than Mari thinks.)": "",
  "You about ready to ante up, Tak? Don't keep a lady waiting.": "",
  "My bad. I'm ready now.": "",
  "Wow, aggressive. All right then.": "",
  "So you're guessing right ahead of me. You sly devil.": "",
  "Oh, and I probably should've mentioned... Loser pays the tab.": "",
  "Just to warn you, Tak. Mari drinks like a fish as it is, but today she's been drinking like a whale. Better watch out.": "",
  "Are you serious!?": "",
  "Relax! Let's just see how this plays out...": "",
  "(Gahhh! Please let me be right!)": "",
  "Hey, pour me another, if you would.": "",
  "Coming right up.": "",
  "Hah! Might as well whip out your wallet right now.": "",
  "I haven't lost just yet! If he gets up after the next one, then it's a draw!": "",
  "Fair enough. Then we'll just have to wait and see.": "",
  "Nice! So far, so good...": "",
  "Don't get too ahead of yourself now. We've got a ways to go, I'd say.": "",
  "Oh man, I gotta hit the can. Back in a sec, bartender.": "",
  "Don't need my permission.": "",
  "Damn, so it was two drinks...": "",
  "Aww, I was off today. Gotta up my game here.": "",
  "So it's a draw, then.": "",
  "Hmph, I guess I could settle for a draw. For today.": "",
  "Whew... That was a close one.": "",
  "Yes! Right on the money!": "",
  "Aww, really? Huh. Not bad, Tak.": "",
  "But I have to know. What made you come to that conclusion?": "",
  "Because of what he's drinking.": "",
  "You know how Red Eyes contain tomato juice?": "",
  "Well, tomato juice is rich in potassium, which is a natural diuretic. Figured sooner was better than later.": "",
  "Wow, you really thought that one through. Guess you're not a detective for nothing, huh? I'm actually impressed.": "",
  "Nah, I was just doing my thing.": "",
  "Then let's do this again sometime. A drink and a bet make any night more interesting.": "",
  "Ah, Tak. Come to cheer me up?": "",
  "What do you mean, you're as radiant as ever.": "",
  "Well, I haven't been working as much, so. Eh.": "",
  "Ah. \"Work,\" right.": "",
  "So, any chance you want to make tonight more interesting with another bet?": "",
  "...Does the loser still have to pay?": "",
  "Really? You're worried about losing before the wager's even made?": "",
  "Yes, but, fine. Let's do it.": "",
  "Hehe, now we're talking.": "",
  "Let's see here... How about we bet on whether the next customer's a guy or a girl?": "",
  "But... that's completely up to luck!": "",
  "Exactly! That's what makes it so exciting! I'm gonna bet on the fairer sex and say \"girl.\"": "",
  "Any objections?": "",
  "It was your idea. I guess that leaves me with the guys.": "",
  "Haha... Then let the contest begin! Luck be a lady tonight, hm?": "",
  "Hey, Tak. Just so you know, Mari's been throwing them back. She's coming for your wallet hard if you lose.": "",
  "Again? Really? Then luck be a dude tonight, please!": "",
  "...This is taking forever. I'm gonna head to the ladies' room for a minute.": "",
  "(Wait a sec... Who says it has to come down to luck?)": "",
  "(Would it really be so wrong... to just call someone over right now?)": "",
  "(I mean, she just sauntered off, she had to be thinking the same thing...)": "",
  "(Well, it's on, then. Now who should I call up...)": "",
  "(Oh, Kaito-san, of course! All right, let's give him a call before Mari comes back...)": "",
  "(Damn it, he's not picking up! Of all the days...!)": "",
  "(How about Genda-sensei? He might be down to drink. Let's see if I can call him before Mari gets back...)": "",
  "(How about Tsukumo? Bet Mari would never see him coming...)": "",
  "Hello? Oh, what can I do for you, Yagami-shi?": "",
  "Sorry to bug, Tsukumo, but I need you to come to Tender right away!": "",
  "Huh? A bar? Me?": "",
  "Please, I know it's tough, but if you could just do me a solid... And do it quick!": "",
  "I don't really get it, but if it's that important to you, sure! Hehe.": "",
  "Sorry! And thanks! Seriously though, I need you to bust your ass!": "",
  "(All right! Now I'll win for sure!)": "",
  "Tak. What were you up to just now?": "",
  "N-Nothing...": "",
  "Nothing? And I was so sure you'd take that opportunity to call up one of your boys.": "",
  "Oh come on... I'd never do something like that. Probably.": "",
  "Certainly not. Besides, it would have been pointless if you had.": "",
  "...And why would that be?": "",
  "Anyone who you'd consider calling is probably off drinking at another bar by now.": "",
  "(...What?)": "",
  "I mean, if you <font_kind=yakuza_italic>were</font_kind> going to call someone, it'd be Kaito-san or Genda-sensei, am I right?": "",
  "Boys will be boys. Not that I'm worried. I had a contingency plan already.": "",
  "I couldn't beat you last time, and losing simply doesn't suit me, so...": "",
  "Haha, I may or may not have made a call to an acquaintance of my own...": "",
  "On top of that, I invited Kaito-kun and Genda-sensei to my other friend's bar.": "",
  "Really? That's... Wow.": "",
  "Should I do my victory dance now or later? *giggle*": "",
  "Maaariii, I'm heeere! ♪ Sorry to keep you waiting!": "",
  "No problem. Ready to drink till you drop?": "",
  "This fine, upstanding gentlemen over here said he'd be happy to foot the bill.": "",
  "Really? Wow, thank you so much!": "",
  "You're such a sweetheart, Tak. Really, you're <font_kind=yakuza_italic>too</font_kind> kind!": "",
  "No! No way! Augh...": "",
  "(That... was horrible. At least we're all settled up now.)": "",
  "(But damn. Mari is not one to be messed with.)": "",
  "Sorry to keep you waiting, Yagami-shi.": "",
  "Geez, took you long en... Wait, who the heck are <font_kind=yakuza_italic>you</font_kind>!?": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "...Tch.": "...เชอะ",
  "I'm afraid so.": "เกรงว่าจะอย่างนั้นครับ",
  "You got it.": "ได้เลย",
  "Are you serious!?": "จริงจังหรือเปล่าเนี่ย!?",
  "Coming right up.": "ได้เลย เดี๋ยวจัดให้"
 }
}
